                          "text":  "I was the first car on the Moon. No roof, no doors, no steering wheel. Just a T-shaped hand controller between two seats.\n\nI rode here folded up like a camping chair on the side of the lander. On July 31, 1971, Dave Scott and Jim Irwin unfolded me, strapped in and drove off. My front steering did not work on that first drive, so we steered with my rear wheels. By the next day it was working.",
